  "details": "Experiencing 3 new bugs since the Update two days ago. \n1. Stuck in AFK, at least the bottom half of me, top half works but i can't move, my avatars legs are crossed in afk position. Disabling afk detection fixed this for now. \n2. Screen going black, started on the second day, just straight up video going black for 1-2 seconds then coming back, happened a few times. Wasn't moving around, sitting still so i doubt it's a cable issue. \n3. Crashing. About 2 hours of play each of the two days i played and crashed 4 times each night. No error message, just closed application. I am developing haptics and have visual studio running in the background, but that program just reads the osc from vrc and has never been an issue, could this be a false positive from eac? Will eac give a message if it detects something?",
